### Sick leave in pregnancy: part-time employment + own firm, 60 days
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calculations/sickness-in-pregnancy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titles": {
    "employment": {"base": "2000.00", "atLeastMinimumWage": false},
    "selfEmployment": {"base": "4877.11", "voluntarySickness": true}
  },
  "days": 60,
  "usedSickPayDays": 0,
  "aged50OrMore": false,
  "insuredDays": 365
}
